QuestGuidance.Register("en",144,{
[4577]="700032F6\n1\tCollect the egg basket\tHolly Hornblower's house is in Hobbiton, behind The Ivy Bush. Pick up the egg basket and carry it to Holly Hornblower in Hobbiton. Be careful that the rooster doesn't see you with the eggs, as he will let out a call that will upset the hens. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Farmer Sandson\tFarmer Sandson is at his farm, west of Waymeet. Holly Hornblower was grateful for the eggs. You should return to Farmer Sandson and let him know the eggs were delivered without incident.\n",
[4578]="70043027\n1\tConfront Egind at the front gate of Imloth Melui\tEgind should be at the front gate of Imloth Melui with the day's delivery of Maresfoot. Brunil has asked you to confront Egind with the knowledge of his treachery.\n2\tTalk to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand\tBrunil can be found in the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui. Egind has confessed that he did not mean to ruin the healing draughts. He substituted a similar-looking plant when he could not collect the proper Maresfoot that Brunil expected.\n",
[4579]="700243CE\n1\tDeliver the black heartwood to Elsa the Bold at the Eglain-camp at Agamaur\030Collect black heartwood (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Elsa the Bold to acquire black heartwood from the creatures of nature within Agamaur. You can find Elsa the Bold within the Eglain-camp in Agamaur.\n",
[4580]="70024361\n1\tDeliver the fur to Lieva Dourlilly at The Forsaken Inn\030Collect blackened fur (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task to acquire tufts of blackened fur for Lieva Dourlilly, a worker at The Forsaken Inn in the Lone-lands. You can find the fur on the beasts in the area of the western Lone-lands.\n",
[4581]="70024392\n1\tDeliver the skins to Lieva Dourlilly at The Forsaken Inn\030Collect blackened skin (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task to acquire patches of blackened skin for Lieva Dourlilly, a worker at The Forsaken Inn in the Lone-lands. You can find the skin from the beasts in the area of the western Lone-lands.\n",
[4582]="70024394\n1\tDeliver the blackened sword sheaths to Gadaric Munce at The Forsaken Inn\030Collect blackened sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task to acquire blackened sword sheaths for Gadaric Munce. Orcs and goblins in the western stretches of the Lone-lands are in possession of these items. You can find Gadaric within The Forsaken Inn.\n",
[4583]="700243D1\n1\tDeliver the broken short bows to Eriac the Strong at the Eglain-camp at Agamaur\030Collect broken short bows (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Eriac the Strong to acquire broken short bows from the intelligent foes within Agamaur. You can find Eriac the Strong within the Eglain-camp at Agamaur.\n",
[4584]="7002439E\n1\tDeliver the broken wood spears to Frideric the Elder at Ost Guruth\030Collect broken wood spears (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Frideric the Elder to acquire broken wood spears from the intelligent creatures in the Lone-lands. You can find Frideric the Elder within Ost Guruth.\n",
[4585]="70024329\n1\tDeliver the broken wooden maces to Gadaric Munce at The Forsaken Inn\030Collect broken wooden maces (total: 10)\tDefeat the sentient creatures found in the westernmost areas of the Lone-lands and collect their broken wooden maces. When you have collected enough you may return them to Gadaric Munce at the Forsaken Inn for a reward.\n",
[4586]="70024396\n1\tDeliver the coarse furs to Lieva Dourlily at The Forsaken Inn\030Collect coarse furs (total: 10)\tThis task requires the acquisition of coarse furs which can be found on the heartier beasts found along the road east into the central Lone-lands. Lieva Dourlily wants the furs to make cloaks. Lieva can be found at The Forsaken Inn.\n",
[4587]="700243C5\n1\tDeliver the coarse fur to Frideric the Elder at Ost Guruth\030Collect coarse fur (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Frideric the Elder to acquire coarse fur from the beasts in the central and eastern Lone-lands. You can find Frideric the Elder within Ost Guruth.\n",
[4588]="7002439A\n1\tDeliver the coarse skin to Lieva Dourlily at The Forsaken Inn\030Collect coarse skins (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Lieva Dourlily to acquire coarse skins from the beasts in the Lone-lands. You can find Lieva Dourlily within The Forsaken Inn.\n",
[4589]="70024393\n1\tDeliver the cracked beaks to Gadaric Munce at The Forsaken Inn\030Collect cracked beaks (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task to acquire cracked beaks for Gadaric Munce. The crebain throughout the western Lone-lands can sometimes have beaks such as these. You can find Gadaric Munce within The Forsaken Inn.\n",
[4590]="700243CC\n1\tDeliver the crooked branches to Elsa the Bold at the Eglain Camp at Agamaur\030Collect Crooked Branch (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Elsa the Bold to acquire crooked branches from the creatures of nature within the swamp of Agamaur. You can find Elsa the Bold within the Eglain-camp in Agamaur.\n",
[4591]="700243D0\n1\tDeliver the decrepit finger bones to Eriac the Strong at the Eglain-camp at Agamaur\030Collect decrepit finger bones (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Eriac the Strong to acquire decrepit finger bones from the Dead within Agamaur. You can find Eriac the Strong within the Eglain-camp in Agamaur.\n",
[4592]="70024366\n1\tDeliver the dusky wings to Gadaric Munce at The Forsaken Inn\030Collect dusky wings (total: 10)\tGadaric Munce of the Eglain posted a desire for dusky wings taken from the crebain that patrol the western Lone-lands. He can be found within The Forsaken Inn.\n",
[4593]="700243B7\n1\tDeliver the flawed ears to Frideric the Elder at Ost Guruth\030Collect flawed ears (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Frideric the Elder to acquire flawed ears from the beasts in the central and eastern Lone-lands. You can find Frideric the Elder within Ost Guruth.\n",
[4594]="700243C3\n1\tDeliver the flawed goo to Frideric the Elder at Ost Guruth\030Collect flawed goo (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Frideric the Elder to acquire flawed goo from the insects in the central and eastern Lone-lands. You can find Frideric the Elder within Ost Guruth.\n",
[4595]="700243CA\n1\tDeliver the glossy essences to Hana the Young at Ost Guruth\030Collect glossy essences (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Hana the Young to acquire glossy essences from the Dead in the eastern Lone-lands. You can find Hana the Young within Ost Guruth.\n",
[4596]="700243CF\n1\tDeliver the heavy carapaces to Elsa the Bold at the Eglain-camp at Agamaur\030Collect heavy carapaces (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Elsa the Bold to acquire heavy carapaces from the creatures of nature within the swamp south of Agamaur. You can find Elsa the Bold within the Eglain-camp in Agamaur.\n",
[4597]="700243D2\n1\tDeliver the heavy sword sheaths to Eriac the Strong at the Eglain-camp at Agamaur\030Collect heavy sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Eriac the Strong to acquire heavy sword sheaths from the intelligent foes within Agamaur. You can find Eriac the Strong within the Eglain-camp in Agamaur.\n",
[4598]="70024398\n1\tDeliver the jagged beaks to Gadaric Munce at the Forsaken Inn\030Collect jagged beaks (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task to acquire jagged beaks for Gadaric Munce. They can be found on the gore-crows which flock along the road east, beneath the shadow of Weathertop. You can find Gadaric within The Forsaken Inn.\n",
[4599]="70024397\n1\tDeliver the large filth to Gadaric Munce at The Forsaken Inn\030Collect large filth (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task to acquire large filth for Gadaric Munce. Spiders beneath the ruins in the western Lone-lands likely teem with the filth. You can find Gadaric within The Forsaken Inn.\n",
